<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Unknown\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tStands shooting at a distance of 2 sqm from the player's target. Every turn it will shoot only one of its abilities.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tUnknown\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>From their release until the Winter Update 2020, there was only one type of Familiar for each vocation, and the Paladin Familiar was simply called <a href=\"#/wiki/Emberwing\">Emberwing</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Birds\">Birds</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Aggressive%20Chicken\">Aggressive Chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Agrestic%20Chicken\">Agrestic Chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Berserker%20Chicken\">Berserker Chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carnivostrich\">Carnivostrich</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Parrot\">Cave Parrot</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chicken\">Chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Parrot\">Demon Parrot</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dire%20Penguin\">Dire Penguin</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flamingo\">Flamingo</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Harpy\">Harpy</a></li><li><a href=